        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-04T16:59:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you think it\u0027s possible to implement a subclass of the `Pass` type defined in this file by delegating the blur work to the `PassGauss` or `DirectBlurX/Y` functions you\u0027ve exposed? \n\nThen we could generalize this algorithm by having it pick the A8 pass, and not have to the large controlling loop that we have in `RasterA8BlurAlgorithm::blur` (but the small A8 blur would be isolated into its own class)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1040,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1053,
        "endChar": 10
      },
      "revId": "f253246dd85645063f4b53899be7b6ecdaaf4016",
